    <div id="pageViewData" data-value="{&quot;DateTaxonomyTerm&quot;:[],&quot;ID&quot;:&quot;12452&quot;,&quot;Title&quot;:&quot;CSV files for download&quot;,&quot;ClassName&quot;:&quot;BlockPage&quot;,&quot;BackgroundColor&quot;:&quot;white&quot;,&quot;FeaturedMedia&quot;:[],&quot;FeaturedText&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Download pre-packaged CSV files of data from Infoshare and Stats NZ information releases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&quot;,&quot;IsPublishing&quot;:false,&quot;MediaPosition&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;PageLayout&quot;:&quot;simple&quot;,&quot;PageLink&quot;:&quot;\/large-datasets\/csv-files-for-download\/&quot;,&quot;PageDate&quot;:&quot;2025-01-17 10:45:00&quot;,&quot;TagPosition&quot;:&quot;bottom&quot;,&quot;MetaDescription&quot;:&quot;Find CSV files with the latest data from Infoshare and our information releases. &quot;,&quot;PageBreadcrumbs&quot;:[{&quot;Title&quot;:&quot;Home&quot;,&quot;MenuTitle&quot;:&quot;Home&quot;,&quot;Link&quot;:&quot;\/&quot;},{&quot;Title&quot;:&quot;Large datasets&quot;,&quot;MenuTitle&quot;:&quot;Large datasets&quot;,&quot;Link&quot;:&quot;\/large-datasets\/&quot;},{&quot;Title&quot;:&quot;CSV files for download&quot;,&quot;MenuTitle&quot;:&quot;CSV files for download&quot;,&quot;Link&quot;:&quot;\/large-datasets\/csv-files-for-download\/&quot;}],&quot;SiteBanner&quot;:[],&quot;PageBlocks&quot;:[{&quot;ID&quot;:&quot;11866&quot;,&quot;Title&quot;:&quot;Description CSV files for download 1&quot;,&quot;ClassName&quot;:&quot;TextBlock&quot;,&quot;ShowBlockTitle&quot;:false,&quot;DefaultView&quot;:&quot;Grid&quot;,&quot;Content&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;intro\&quot;&gt;The CSV files on this page contain the latest data from Infoshare and our &lt;a href=\&quot;\/publications\/\&quot;&gt;information releases&lt;\/a&gt;. 2013 Census meshblock data is also available in CSV format.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can download CSV files about entire Infoshare subjects. This saves you downloading multiple files fro